# Build inputs (ADR-0008), never shipped: the BYU databases core.53.db and
# content.53.db, the derivation inputs derived/gc-YYYY-MM.json, and the cached
# downloads the build tools' headers name (engwebp_usfm.zip, scripture/,
# wikisource-jod.json, jod-talks/). The databases and derivation inputs live
# in the owner's private repo (#82); fill the directory from it with
#   git clone <private-repo-url> /tmp/btx-private && cp -r /tmp/btx-private/source-data .
# (the databases are also in this repo's LFS history at commit 0d154d7, "Add
# BYU citation index databases": git checkout 0d154d7 -- core.53.db content.53.db).
/source-data
/core.53.db
/content.53.db

# The personal pack (ADR-0008): the personal build's data pack, holding the
# gated element. Never committed; the private repo holds the built pack —
#   git clone <private-repo-url> /tmp/btx-private && cp -r /tmp/btx-private/data-personal src/citations/
# — or build it from the inputs above with
#   node --experimental-sqlite tools/build-citation-data.js --pack personal
/src/citations/data-personal/

# macOS Finder droppings, and the scratch worktrees agents work in.
.DS_Store
/.claude/worktrees/

# Store zips built by tools/build-store-zip.js.
/dist/
